### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Get Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories

### 3. Customer Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Karan Mehra",
  "email": "karan.mehra@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98111 22334",
  "password": "password123",
  "city": "New Delhi"
}

### 4. Worker Registration
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-worker
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dev Sharma",
  "email": "dev.sharma@example.com",
  "phone": "+91 98222 33445",
  "password": "password123",
  "profession": "Electrician",
  "category": "electrician",
  "hourlyRate": 350,
  "experience": "4+ Years",
  "city": "New Delhi",
  "location": "New Delhi, India",
  "skills": ["Inverter Setup", "Short Circuit Repair", "MCB Wiring"]
}

### 5. Customer Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aarav.singhal@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "customer"
}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Search & Filter Workers (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/workers?q=Electrician&loc=Delhi&minRating=4.5&maxPrice=500&sortBy=rating-desc

### 8. Get Single Worker Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/workers/w-1

### 9. Get Jobs
GET {{baseUrl}}/jobs?category=electrician&status=Open

### 10. Post a New Job (Customer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Living Room Ceiling Fan & Smart Switchboard Setup",
  "category": "electrician",
  "description": "Need skilled electrician to replace standard switches with smart WiFi switches and hang 2 BLDC ceiling fans.",
  "location": "Sector 15, Noida (Delhi NCR)",
  "budget": 1200,
  "paymentType": "Fixed Price",
  "requiredExperience": "3+ Years",
  "preferredDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### 11. Create a Service Booking (Hire Worker)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workerId": "65e000000000000000000001",
  "serviceTitle": "Complete House Wiring Inspection",
  "serviceDate": "2026-11-18",
  "serviceTime": "11:00 AM",
  "location": "Flat 302, Green Valley Apartments, Delhi NCR",
  "instructions": "Please bring multi-meter tester.",
  "amount": 600
}

### 12. Get My Bookings (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 13. Update Booking Status (Accept / In Progress / Completed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/bookings/65e000000000000000000002/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Accepted"
}

### 14. Submit Review for Completed Booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "65e000000000000000000002",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Outstanding electrician! Resolved the tripping issue quickly and cleanly."
}

### 15. Get Notifications (Protected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Admin Statistics (Admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

